 "description": "When a Cosmic Ray (elementary particle or nuclei originating outside the atmosphere of earth) enters\nthe Earth’s atmosphere and interacts, a cascade of particles is generated. This cascade is called a\nCosmic Air Shower and it can be envisioned as a large natural particle factory. The type, nature,\nenergy spectrum and composition of a cosmic air shower are very interesting and they can lead us\nto identify the primary cosmic ray. In this talk, I’ll give a brief overview of cosmic air showers, their\ndetection techniques and the current research scenario.",
